  "name": "Subscriptions: MRR & Churn (low-code)",
  "description": "Recurring revenue month by month with the subscriber base behind it, last month's churn, what moved MRR over the last 12 months and why subscribers left, which plans carry the revenue, and how much of itself each signup cohort keeps month over month.",
  "connection_id": "rbt-sample-northwind-duckdb-4f2",
